OL,3,GNEWSADog control order could extend to
OL,4,Acountry parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has proposed extending a dog
OL,7,Fcontrol public space protection order
OL,8,F(PSPO) to include country parks.
OL,10,FNorth Northamptonshire Council
OL,11,Fintroduced a PSPO that covered all
OL,12,Fpublic land in the authority's area in
OL,13,F2023, which is due to expire at the end
OL,14,Fof November.
OL,16,FUnder the order dog owners can be fined
OL,17,For given fixed penalty notices if they
OL,18,Ffail to keep their dogs on a lead in
OL,19,Fcertain areas.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
