OL,3,GNEWSADog control order could extend to
OL,4,Acountry parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FKirk Harrison, the council's executive
OL,7,Fmember for regulatory services, said:
OL,8,F"We know that most dog owners in the
OL,9,FNorth Northants area are responsible
OL,10,Fand enforcement will only ever be used
OL,11,Fas a last resort."
